1
00:00:39,960 --> 00:00:41,960
Tell me about my biological father.

2
00:00:42,320 --> 00:00:43,280
Now.

3
00:00:45,770 --> 00:00:47,250
You and Jiang Yu went to great lengths

4
00:00:47,250 --> 00:00:48,640
to bring me here

5
00:00:48,890 --> 00:00:51,600
just to avenge Jiang Yuqing, didn't you?

6
00:00:51,770 --> 00:00:54,490
Wen Jianan, you've got the wrong person.

7
00:00:54,890 --> 00:00:56,810
Is what you saw and found out

8
00:00:57,080 --> 00:00:58,600
really the truth?

9
00:01:00,810 --> 00:01:01,680
Jiang Yuqing

10
00:01:02,360 --> 00:01:03,170
is the only woman

11
00:01:03,170 --> 00:01:04,970
I've ever truly loved in my life.

12
00:01:05,280 --> 00:01:06,610
Why would I kill her?

13
00:01:07,240 --> 00:01:09,770
I wanted her alive more than anyone else.

14
00:01:10,080 --> 00:01:11,360
Even if she hates me,

15
00:01:11,710 --> 00:01:14,940
it's better than living like a corpse
all these years.

16
00:01:15,770 --> 00:01:16,570
He Mu.

17
00:01:17,850 --> 00:01:18,880
Even now, you are still

18
00:01:18,880 --> 00:01:20,520
pretending to be affectionate.

19
00:01:20,520 --> 00:01:22,520
That's what they wanted you to hear.

20
00:01:22,770 --> 00:01:24,360
I am afraid the truth

21
00:01:24,520 --> 00:01:25,690
would break you.

22
00:01:26,520 --> 00:01:28,240
You wouldn't be able to handle it.

23
00:01:28,240 --> 00:01:30,880
The person you've always respected,

24
00:01:31,490 --> 00:01:33,000
admired, and relied on

25
00:01:33,000 --> 00:01:35,850
is the real devil in human skin.

26
00:01:36,360 --> 00:01:38,289
What exactly are you trying to say?

27
00:01:44,850 --> 00:01:45,970
It's Wen Yanhui.

28
00:01:46,610 --> 00:01:50,000
He was the one who told me
to get close to Wen Xin and control her.

29
00:01:50,000 --> 00:01:51,490
He also ordered me to get rid of

30
00:01:51,490 --> 00:01:54,000
Jiang Yuqing, the unstable factor.

31
00:01:54,050 --> 00:01:55,280
Because Jiang Yuqing knew too many

32
00:01:55,280 --> 00:01:57,210
of the Wen family's dirty secrets.

33
00:01:57,470 --> 00:02:01,180
And when I was hesitating,

34
00:02:01,490 --> 00:02:04,330
he controlled me
by threatening what I feared losing most.

35
00:02:04,330 --> 00:02:07,020
Wen Yanhui is the real murderer.

36
00:02:07,050 --> 00:02:11,290
I'm nothing but a bloodstained knife

37
00:02:11,490 --> 00:02:14,680
he is ready to discard
because it's gotten too dirty.

38
00:02:16,120 --> 00:02:17,210
You hate him, so you want to

39
00:02:17,210 --> 00:02:19,270
drag him down with you before you die.

40
00:02:20,010 --> 00:02:20,930
Why should I believe

41
00:02:20,930 --> 00:02:22,530
the crazy talk of a murderer?

42
00:02:22,770 --> 00:02:23,890
I knew it.

43
00:02:24,120 --> 00:02:25,520
Even if you knew the truth,

44
00:02:25,520 --> 00:02:26,960
you wouldn't dare kill him,

45
00:02:26,960 --> 00:02:31,010
because Wen Yanhui
is your biological father.

46
00:02:32,360 --> 00:02:35,120
Your grandfather is actually
your real father.

47
00:02:36,680 --> 00:02:37,490
Wen Jianan.

48
00:02:37,490 --> 00:02:39,740
You are the bastard he had
with another woman.

49
00:02:39,740 --> 00:02:41,870
Your entire Wen family are animals.

50
00:02:41,960 --> 00:02:42,800
Animals.

51
00:02:44,060 --> 00:02:45,260
Alright, put it down.

52
00:02:46,010 --> 00:02:46,640
I'm telling you.

53
00:02:46,640 --> 00:02:47,300
Put it down.

54
00:02:47,360 --> 00:02:48,890
If you want to know everything,

55
00:02:48,890 --> 00:02:50,130
go ask Wen Xin.

56
00:02:50,150 --> 00:02:51,870
Wen Xin will tell you.

57
00:02:52,079 --> 00:02:52,800
Put it down.

58
00:02:52,980 --> 00:02:53,510
Go.

59
00:02:53,579 --> 00:02:54,300
Animals.

60
00:02:54,329 --> 00:02:55,010
Go.

61
00:02:55,460 --> 00:02:57,110
[Dearest Episode 13]

62
00:03:12,760 --> 00:03:15,120
[20 years ago]

63
00:03:20,150 --> 00:03:22,220
Good. I wasn't wrong about you.

64
00:03:22,520 --> 00:03:23,930
If you hadn't told me,

65
00:03:23,960 --> 00:03:25,270
I never would have known

66
00:03:25,270 --> 00:03:26,800
that the Cheng family's son

67
00:03:27,079 --> 00:03:29,210
was trying to hook up with my daughter.

68
00:03:30,010 --> 00:03:32,540
I've been
fighting with his father for years.

69
00:03:32,640 --> 00:03:34,490
There is no way

70
00:03:34,770 --> 00:03:36,700
I'm letting him marry my daughter.

71
00:03:37,329 --> 00:03:38,730
Have her get an abortion.

72
00:04:20,440 --> 00:04:23,610
You're abandoning me
to be with that woman.

73
00:04:25,530 --> 00:04:27,860
You're just after the Wen family's money.

74
00:04:30,680 --> 00:04:31,560
You're right.

75
00:04:32,880 --> 00:04:34,740
I am after the Wen family's money.

76
00:04:35,170 --> 00:04:36,360
I'm only with her

77
00:04:36,880 --> 00:04:38,680
so I can take over the Wen family.

78
00:04:41,730 --> 00:04:42,530
Yuqing.

79
00:04:42,680 --> 00:04:44,970
I want you to have a better life.

80
00:04:45,330 --> 00:04:46,920
That's why I'm with her.

81
00:04:47,680 --> 00:04:49,050
However, I promise you,

82
00:04:49,320 --> 00:04:51,850
you will have everything she has.

83
00:04:55,090 --> 00:04:55,760
Yuqing.

84
00:04:57,050 --> 00:04:58,850
I had no choice but to be with her.

85
00:05:00,200 --> 00:05:02,170
You are the life I truly want.

86
00:05:05,240 --> 00:05:07,170
I spent all my savings on this ring,

87
00:05:07,240 --> 00:05:09,610
made from volcanic stone, just for you.

88
00:05:13,240 --> 00:05:15,120
It's one of a kind in the world.

89
00:05:16,200 --> 00:05:17,930
Once I take over the Wen family,

90
00:05:18,200 --> 00:05:21,120
I will have you by my side,
openly and proudly,

91
00:05:21,120 --> 00:05:23,000
as the rightful lady of the house.

92
00:05:30,090 --> 00:05:31,090
Leave.

93
00:05:31,600 --> 00:05:32,710
Don't come back.

94
00:05:32,990 --> 00:05:34,909
This family doesn't need you.

95
00:05:39,680 --> 00:05:40,850
Don't be too sad.

96
00:05:42,000 --> 00:05:42,800
In the future,

97
00:05:44,490 --> 00:05:45,320
we will also have

98
00:05:45,320 --> 00:05:46,680
a child of our own.

99
00:05:59,360 --> 00:06:00,090
Dad.

100
00:06:02,170 --> 00:06:03,390
She was born from another woman

101
00:06:03,390 --> 00:06:05,390
who got into my bed while I was drunk.

102
00:06:05,700 --> 00:06:07,180
Since you lost your child,

103
00:06:08,230 --> 00:06:10,260
just raise her as your own.

104
00:06:20,730 --> 00:06:22,730
It was only later that I realized...

105
00:06:24,650 --> 00:06:26,180
Chenghan's death back then

106
00:06:27,050 --> 00:06:28,860
must have been allowed by Dad.

107
00:06:29,440 --> 00:06:30,170
Otherwise, none of this

108
00:06:30,170 --> 00:06:32,500
could have happened right under his nose.

109
00:06:32,940 --> 00:06:34,909
Someone who shares my blood

110
00:06:35,200 --> 00:06:37,130
killed the person I loved the most.

111
00:06:38,480 --> 00:06:39,480
It's ridiculous.

112
00:06:43,550 --> 00:06:44,300
Yeah.

113
00:06:46,290 --> 00:06:47,440
It's ridiculous.

114
00:06:50,409 --> 00:06:52,970
I'm actually Wen Yanhui's child.

115
00:06:55,880 --> 00:06:59,360
And you... are my sister.

116
00:07:03,050 --> 00:07:04,970
I didn't know who my father was.

117
00:07:05,970 --> 00:07:08,880
Now, I don't know who my mother is.

118
00:07:09,930 --> 00:07:11,850
I lost my child back then.

119
00:07:13,760 --> 00:07:15,320
Dad brought you back.

120
00:07:16,560 --> 00:07:18,360
For a long time,

121
00:07:18,560 --> 00:07:20,760
I treated you as my own child.

122
00:07:21,610 --> 00:07:23,680
I projected all the love for that child

123
00:07:23,680 --> 00:07:25,490
onto you.

124
00:07:27,090 --> 00:07:29,090
But later I suddenly realized

125
00:07:29,880 --> 00:07:32,240
that it was unfair to my dead child.

126
00:07:35,320 --> 00:07:36,880
I'm sorry, Jianan,

127
00:07:37,409 --> 00:07:38,870
for treating you so badly.

128
00:07:39,090 --> 00:07:40,240
You're right.

129
00:07:41,130 --> 00:07:42,570
I am pathetic.

130
00:07:43,110 --> 00:07:45,350
The only person who truly loved me

131
00:07:46,120 --> 00:07:47,320
was murdered.

132
00:07:47,930 --> 00:07:49,800
And I married the murderer.

133
00:07:50,440 --> 00:07:53,760
My father made me raise his child

134
00:07:55,220 --> 00:07:58,020
to cover up the scandal
of his illegitimate child.

135
00:07:58,720 --> 00:08:01,160
Jianan, you wouldn't understand.

136
00:08:01,800 --> 00:08:03,880
You're a shining superstar.

137
00:08:04,800 --> 00:08:06,410
Everyone likes you.

138
00:08:09,000 --> 00:08:09,800
And I...

139
00:08:12,680 --> 00:08:14,680
I just keep rotting away, day by day.

140
00:08:15,680 --> 00:08:17,200
This isn't over.

141
00:08:18,540 --> 00:08:21,540
There are still many answers
waiting to come to light.

142
00:08:24,170 --> 00:08:25,170
Some people still

143
00:08:26,240 --> 00:08:28,000
haven't paid the price yet.

144
00:08:29,290 --> 00:08:31,350
When your child was killed back then,

145
00:08:31,680 --> 00:08:34,250
Wen Yanhui allowed it to happen.

146
00:08:34,710 --> 00:08:37,870
So when He Mu framed me,

147
00:08:38,250 --> 00:08:40,320
it's highly likely he knew about it too.

148
00:08:40,320 --> 00:08:42,380
But he still chose to turn a blind eye.

149
00:08:45,130 --> 00:08:46,440
Because this way,

150
00:08:46,840 --> 00:08:48,970
he could kill two birds with one stone.

151
00:08:49,010 --> 00:08:50,200
With one life,

152
00:08:50,200 --> 00:08:52,530
he could control both me and He Mu.

153
00:08:55,250 --> 00:08:56,530
If he really is the one

154
00:08:56,530 --> 00:08:58,410
who turned all our lives and destinies

155
00:08:58,410 --> 00:08:59,560
upside down

156
00:08:59,560 --> 00:09:02,500
while sitting back
and reaping the benefits,

157
00:09:03,050 --> 00:09:05,930
I won't sit by and do nothing anymore.

158
00:09:10,200 --> 00:09:11,600
I promised Jiang Yu

159
00:09:13,940 --> 00:09:16,180
that everyone who hurt us

160
00:09:17,840 --> 00:09:19,680
would pay the price.

161
00:09:20,410 --> 00:09:23,680
Wen Xin,
are you really willing to just let it go?

162
00:09:25,780 --> 00:09:27,910
But what can I possibly do against him?

163
00:09:30,130 --> 00:09:31,610
What else can I do?

164
00:09:31,890 --> 00:09:33,440
Everyone has weaknesses.

165
00:09:33,770 --> 00:09:35,860
Wen Yanhui must have one too.

166
00:09:36,540 --> 00:09:38,140
You know him better than I do.

167
00:09:38,480 --> 00:09:39,890
I need you to tell me

168
00:09:40,480 --> 00:09:41,840
what he fears most

169
00:09:42,370 --> 00:09:44,430
and what he's most desperate to hide.

170
00:09:45,290 --> 00:09:47,080
How could he have weaknesses?

171
00:09:50,080 --> 00:09:51,940
He has always been the authority.

172
00:09:52,370 --> 00:09:53,650
He is unquestionable.

173
00:09:54,930 --> 00:09:56,390
Whatever he does is right.

174
00:09:56,800 --> 00:09:58,290
Even the whole Wen...

175
00:10:01,530 --> 00:10:02,290
What is it?

176
00:10:06,320 --> 00:10:07,480
He has a weakness.

177
00:10:08,770 --> 00:10:09,770
There is someone.

178
00:10:10,890 --> 00:10:13,480
Her death was very sudden,

179
00:10:14,650 --> 00:10:15,600
and suspicious.

180
00:10:16,290 --> 00:10:17,010
Who?

181
00:10:17,410 --> 00:10:18,170
Wen Yan.

182
00:10:20,320 --> 00:10:21,410
My mother,

183
00:10:22,650 --> 00:10:23,410
Wen Yan.
